      <h2>Connect your app to storage</h2>
      <p>Everything you need to store, list, download, and delete files from your own applications using the TFSrun S3-compatible object storage service (MinIO). Follow the steps in order — by the end, file upload from your code will work with no open questions about the connection.</p>
